# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 25thCRX / DCO — .gitignore
#
# Goal: keep the human-authored source (scripts, .et/.conf/.layout, docs, the
# .png/.json source assets and the .gproj) in version control, and leave out
# everything the Enfusion Workbench regenerates locally on import/build.
#
# NOTE: .meta files are deliberately excluded. They are per-machine resource
# bookkeeping that the Workbench rebuilds; the GUIDs that actually matter live
# inside the .conf/.et source and are committed. Re-import the addon in the
# Workbench after cloning to regenerate the .meta sidecars and the resource DB.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Workbench resource bookkeeping (regenerated on import)
*.meta

# Local resource database / caches (engine-deployed, never source)
*.rdb
resourceDatabase.rdb

# Engine-converted textures (built from the committed .png sources)
*.edds

# Workbench build / temp output
/build/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.backup

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
